"The pivot view is represented by the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot"
" table)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Изгледът обобщена таблица е представен от иконата :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`(pivot table)`."

#: ../../docs/content/contributing/documentation/rst_guidelines.rst:346
msgid ""
"Use :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`(global filters)` in Odoo "
"**Spreadsheet**."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`(global filters)` в Odoo "
"**Spreadsheet**."

